---
description: Friendship Book project conventions
alwaysApply: true
---
- A mobile-first friendship book web app (phones and tablets): type, draw, and place stickers.
- Stack: SvelteKit with Svelte 5 runes ($state, $props), TypeScript, SCSS (`<style lang="scss">`), Supabase (`src/lib/supabase.ts`).
- Package manager: pnpm only (`pnpm dev --host`, `pnpm build`, `pnpm check`).
- This SvelteKit version uses `#lib` instead of `$lib` for imports.
- Supabase env vars: `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`, `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` in `.env` (never commit it).
- Use pointer events and `touch-action: none` for drawing; respect safe-area insets.
